# An allowlist (L353, L364): the build context holds only the paths listed below, with no
# bytecode cache under backend/: backend/ and the three files uv sync reads, and the
# frontend's build inputs, never its node_modules or dist. CI's image job lists the context
# and checks it.
*
!backend/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!frontend/.npmrc
!frontend/index.html
!frontend/tsconfig.json
!frontend/vite.config.ts
!frontend/src/
backend/**/__pycache__
